# Railway deploy

When a batch of work is finished (UI polish, features, fixes ready to ship):

1. Commit relevant changes on `main` (never ask whether to commit/push for Railway).
2. Push to `origin/main` immediately so Railway redeploys.
3. Do not ask “залить на Railway?” — just do it after the work is done.
4. Still never commit secrets (`.env`, credentials). Skip those and warn once if needed.
